      "topLeftX": 106,
      "topLeftY": 136,
      "bottomRightX": 365,
      "bottomRightY": 154,
      "content": "Die erste der Gleichungen (73) liefert:",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 106,
      "topLeftY": 159,
      "bottomRightX": 583,
      "bottomRightY": 233,
      "content": "$$\\left. \\begin{aligned} 2 \\omega_0 a_n \\omega_{n,n+1}^{(2)} + 2 a_n x_{n+1} + 2 a_n x_n + \\bar{a}_{n-1} x'_{n-1} + a_{n+1} x'_n &= 0, \\\\ - 8 \\omega_0^2 y'_n + a_n x'_{n+1} + a_{n+2} x'_n &= 0, \\\\ \\omega_{n,n-2}^{(1)} &= 0, \\end{aligned} \\right\\} (77)$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "equation"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 106,
      "topLeftY": 239,
      "bottomRightX": 583,
      "bottomRightY": 279,
      "content": "die zweite Gleichung ist nicht identisch erfüllt, sondern liefert eine Bestimmungsgleichung für $y_n$:",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 106,
      "topLeftY": 285,
      "bottomRightX": 583,
      "bottomRightY": 354,
      "content": "$$\\left. \\begin{aligned} a_n \\bar{y}_n + \\bar{a}_n y_n - a_{n-1} \\bar{y}_{n-1} - \\bar{a}_{n-1} y_{n-1} + 2 |x'|^2 - 2 |x'_{n-2}|^2 \\\\ - \\frac{\\omega_{n,n+1}^{(2)}}{\\omega_0} |a_n|^2 - \\frac{\\omega_{n,n-1}^{(2)}}{\\omega_0} |a_{n-1}|^2 &= 0. \\end{aligned} \\right\\} (78)$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "equation"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 106,
      "topLeftY": 358,
      "bottomRightX": 232,
      "bottomRightY": 375,
      "content": "Die Lösung lautet:",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 177,
      "topLeftY": 379,
      "bottomRightX": 583,
      "bottomRightY": 460,
      "content": "$$\\left. \\begin{aligned} \\omega_{n,n+1}^{(2)} &= \\frac{1}{3 \\omega_0^3} (|a_{n+1}|^2 + |a_{n-1}|^2 + 3 |a_n|^2), \\\\ y'_n &= \\frac{1}{12 \\omega_0^4} a_n a_{n+1} a_{n+2}. \\end{aligned} \\right\\} (79)$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "equation"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 106,
      "topLeftY": 465,
      "bottomRightX": 321,
      "bottomRightY": 483,
      "content": "Setzt man ferner zur Abkürzung",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 272,
      "topLeftY": 492,
      "bottomRightX": 583,
      "bottomRightY": 512,
      "content": "$$\\eta_n = a_n \\bar{y}_n + \\bar{a}_n y_n, \\quad (80)$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "equation"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 106,
      "topLeftY": 519,
      "bottomRightX": 358,
      "bottomRightY": 537,
      "content": "so bestimmt sich $\\eta$ aus der Gleichung",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 159,
